        "text": "Fernando \"Fefo\" Alcide Barrichello (born 12 September 2005) is a Brazilian racing driver who last competed in the FIA Formula 3 Championship for AIX Racing.\n\nBarrichello previously competed in the Euroformula Open, finishing third in 2024. He is the youngest son of Formula One race winner, Rubens Barrichello and the younger brother of Eduardo Barrichello.",
